Z||000008||FIEROCIOUS||02-10-2000||03:43 PM||||Fabricate the Turbo exhaust manifold so that all four tubes lead in strait to the turbo, get a turbo decide which flange you need weld it to the turbo exhaust manifold, then route a tube from out side the engine compartment (put in the space the resornator box resides) install a filter and connect to the turbo inlet. get anouther tube from the air outlet put it on the TBI the exhaust outlet needs to goto a muffler and out the back. The computer has to be set up with a dual map one at regular atmostpheric pressure the other at boost pressure. run coolant lines to the turbo and make the oil drainback from the turbo as large as possable. this should confuse you more! LOL ||||reg||1
