Z||000018||SloPonti||02-11-2000||12:07 AM||||Well i have to say that if you can't find anything for your fiero four banger than you are not looking hard enough!! i rebuilt my 84 four banger about two months ago and now i have a hopped up iron duck! i have new hypetechtic pistons-new rods-new compition cam from comp cams-new crank-new lifters-new arp rod bolts-new high volume oil pump-new push rods-new valve springs-k&n air filter-hooker tri y header-dual exhaust-4.5 inch custom tips! my car even has a thump to it at itle from the cam! i have not driven it yet becaust still now done but she sure does sound good!! check out <A HREF="http://www.homestead.com/fierorock/fierorock.html" TARGET=_blank>www.homestead.com/fierorock/fierorock.html</A> <P>this website was set up for my motor for me! thanks<BR>rob||||reg||1
