Z||000044||kidzwheelz||02-19-2000||10:27 AM||||  Great investigative work, Oz. This is pretty much the route I was planning to take with the knock sensor and 2.0 computer. I did not know about the Grand Am Turbo, and that may make finding one a little easier. By the way, the ignition module problem mentioned in the fierojoe article is probably easily overcome by using the one on the Sunbird or now Grand Am. Slight modifications required to the distributor, of course. Thanks again, Oz. And let's make sure there are two more turbo dukes on the road within the next year!!! ||||reg||14
