Z||000049||theogre||02-21-2000||07:01 PM||||Who ever was looking at more injector capacity,,,,,,<P>GM also has a 200 series TBI(I think it's 200. can't find my book.). It's related to the 300 but is a 2 barrel unit. It's generaly used for V6 or V8 aplications. Wouldn't be to hard to add in injector driver the 300 TBI compatible ECM. Running the 2 barrel should give you more than enough volume without worrying about running it like a secondary. would be easier job of programming a fuel map for it. Might even work with a stock map depending on just what 200 is used.||||reg||1
