Z||000051||SCCA FIERO||02-21-2000||07:42 PM||||Hey guys, I wanna check out what you have done so far. I am trying to turbo my V6 and need all the help I can get. <B>mwbackus</B> was interested as well (maybe not anymore cuz I think he got bit by the 4.3 bug) but I have a few of the parts that I need already. I have the "Y" pipe and downpipe and the turbo with an intercooler. The "Y" pipe I have has the EGR bracket in it and is stainless steel 1 3/4" pipe with a section of flexible pipe for expansion. This thing is very nice looking and is very high quality... pics of it soon. I also installed a drain in my oilpan for the return line from the turbo too. I need to get something for the timing (maybe the MSD BTM) and of course a rising rate fuel regulator (or something to get more fuel to the motor). <B>terryk</B> is a GM ECM hacker and I think he could be of help. Lemme know if you guys want to meet sometime and swap ideas or we can just do it here.<p>[This message has been edited by SCCA FIERO (edited 02-21-2000).]||||reg||6
