Z||000094||FIEROCIOUS||03-10-2000||01:38 AM||||Ozzy, Heres the skinny.<P>They just made me the parts manager at PepBoys wich has taken a serious chunk of my social life! I haven't seen my wife in a week! <P>As for Kidz, his wife left him and took the computer.<BR>However don't despair we've made progress. We have a ECM from a quad four TerryK told us to get, but hasn't responded on exactly what to do with it. I have a few ideas were to stick it (Kidz wifes bum!)<P>I also came up with another solution on the computer side, A MSD 6BTM ignition, it uses a map sensor to adjust timeing for boost conditions! I think this is the way to go. just add a riseing rate fuel pressure riser and presto done!<P>We still need routing ideas for the turbo inlet/outlet. We will do this even if fate is against us!<P>Sorry I haven't kept you posted. I'm taking away from my sleep to keep your spirits up!||||reg||1
